---

<Base title="Counseling & Therapy in CT | Hopewell Health Solutions" description="Counseling & therapy at Hopewell Health Solutions in CT — individual, couples & family counseling for ages 4+. In person & virtual. Most insurance accepted." image={P + "westbrook-counseling-office.webp"}>
  <Header />
  <main class="hw">
    <ServiceHero
      crumbs={[{ label: "Programs", href: "/programs/" }, { label: "Counseling" }]}
      title="Counseling &amp; Therapy in Connecticut"
      lede="Counseling &amp; Therapy · Glastonbury, CT · In person &amp; virtual. Sometimes you just need a great therapist who gets you."
      bullets={heroUsps}
      facts={[{ icon: "star", text: "4.8 · 368 Google reviews" }, { icon: "pin", text: "All six CT offices" }]}
      image={P + "east-hampton-therapy-office.webp"}
    >
      <p style="margin-top:18px;font-size:14.5px;color:#b9cbe0">Medically reviewed by <a class="inl" href="/provider/kristine-a-schlichting-ph-d/">Kristine Schlichting, PhD</a></p>
    </ServiceHero>
    <Creds />

    <Split heading="What is counseling?" img="/Assets/service/therapy-room.webp" alt="A calming counseling room at Hopewell Health Solutions, Glastonbury CT" img2={P + "westbrook-counseling-office.webp"} alt2="A private counseling office at our Westbrook location">
      <p><strong>Help at your own pace.</strong> Counseling is talk therapy — a licensed clinician helps you work through difficult life situations and conditions like <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/depression/">depression</a> and <a class="inl" href="/what-we-treat/anxiety/">anxiety</a>, and build coping strategies that actually stick. Sessions typically run about 60 minutes, once or twice a week depending on what you need.</p>
      <p>One in five adults lives with a mental health condition. With the right support, life’s hardest stretches get more manageable — and you don’t have to face them alone. It’s a highly effective, flexible way to feel better and function better.</p>
    </Split>

    <IconCards heading="Who counseling is for" lede="Whoever you’re carrying it with." items={whoFor} cols={3} tone="stone" />

    <section class="section is-white">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sec-head"><h2>Support for life’s challenges</h2><p class="lede">What we help with.</p></div>
        <ul class="pg-mods c3">
          {helpWith.map((c) => <li><span class="pg-mod-icon"><Icon name={c.icon} class="h-5 w-5" /></span><span set:html={c.t} /></li>)}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <IconCards heading="How we work" lede="Evidence-based &amp; tailored to you." items={howWeWork} cols={3} tone="mist" />

    <section class="section is-white">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sec-head"><h2>Counseling vs. IOP</h2><p class="lede"><strong>Find the right level.</strong> Weekly counseling is the right starting point for many people. If you need more structure, we’ll help you step up — seamlessly.</p></div>
        <div class="levels-grid pg-vs">
          <Schedule title="Weekly counseling" stat="60 min" note="once or twice a week" days={[1, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0]} max={3} tone={1} icon="heart">
            <p>About <strong>60 minutes, once or twice a week</strong> — flexible, personal support at your own pace. The right starting point for most people.</p>
          </Schedule>
          <Schedule title="Need more structure?" stat="3–6 h" note="a day, several days a week" days={[3, 3, 3, 3, 0, 0, 0]} max={3} tone={3} icon="refresh">
            <p>Our <a class="inl" href="/programs/intensive-outpatient-program/">IOP</a> and <a class="inl" href="/programs/partial-hospitalization-program/">PHP</a> add several days a week of support — and your therapist helps you move between levels.</p>
          </Schedule>
        </div>
        <p class="levels-key"><span class="key-swatch"></span>Example week: sessions per day (one or two weekly counseling sessions vs. a 4-day IOP)</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <Quote text="“You’re not just a number. I feel as if my voice is valued.”" img={P + "east-hampton-counseling-room.webp"} />

    <IconCards heading="Why people choose us for therapy" lede="Why Hopewell Health Solutions." items={unique} tone="stone" />

    <VideoCarousel videos={stories} heading="Client Stories, in Their Own Words" lede="Clients share what getting help at Hopewell was like. Hear more on the <a class='inl' href='/podcast/'>Hope, Health &amp; Healing podcast</a>." />

    <MediaStrip bg="white" heading="Our clinicians, featured across Connecticut" />
    <Reviews heading="What Our Clients Say" first={["Therapy", "Outpatient care"]} />
    <Team heading="Meet Some of Our Therapists" lede="Licensed counselors, social workers, marriage &amp; family therapists and psychologists across six offices. <a class='inl' href='/about-us/team/'>Meet our full team</a>." slugs={["dori-bessette-crail-lmft", "joanne-malinka-lcsw", "jessenia-medina-lpc-ncc", "kimberly-devine-lcsw", "nathan-truong-lmft-a", "eunice-rivera-miranda-ph-d", "meagan-carr-ph-d"]} tone="stone" />

    <Insurance heading="Most major PPO plans accepted" lede="We’re in-network with most major PPO plans. Our team verifies your benefits at no cost — before you commit to anything." tone="white" />
    <Locations heading="Our Locations" lede="In person at six Connecticut offices — plus virtual visits statewide. Reach us at <a class='inl' href='tel:8607351448'>(860) 735-1448</a> · <a class='inl' href='mailto:hhs4help@gmail.com'>hhs4help@gmail.com</a>." />
    <Faq faqs={faqs} heading="Counseling — common questions" tone="white" />
    <OtherPrograms current="/programs/counseling/" />
    <ClosingCta heading="Find your therapist" lede="The right therapist can change everything. Reach out to Hopewell Health Solutions today — confidentially, with no pressure — and we’ll help you find yours." image={P + "westbrook-counseling-office.webp"} imageAlt="A private counseling office at our Westbrook location" />
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>
